            "unique": [
                "Watchtower is up. We see everything. Every single thing.",
                "Watchtower here. Bandits marked. First shot is yours.",
                "Watchtower on station. Nothing sneaks past us. Nothing.",
                "Watchtower: contacts painted. Go get them.",
                "Watchtower orbiting. Avalanche risk for them: extreme.",
