            "bounce": [
                "Bombs bounced off {node}. Griffin's saying he saw that coming.",
                "BOING! That {enemy} fence is springier than fresh powder.",
                "Payload came back up to 14,000 feet. That's OUR altitude.",
            ],
            "park": [
                "Crew's at the park. Pan found the picnic table. It's his now.",
                "Griffin set up a radar dish by the pond. On his night off.",
                "Pan's asleep in tunnel two. Nobody can get through. Nobody minds.",
