            "fetch": [
                "Thin air, long carry. Big Fetch headed for {node}.",
                "Griffin says it lands on {node}. He's never wrong. It's exhausting.",
                "Ball's over the peaks. Pan wants to chase it. Somebody hold Pan.",
            ],
