                "We're ahead. Somebody frame this chart and hang it over my bed.",
            ],
            losing: [
                "It's not a loss. It's a pivot.",
                "Okay, so we're pre-revenue on Bragging Rights. Temporarily.",
                "Let's take this offline and win it later.",
                "We're behind. That's just the trough of sorrow. Very normal. Very temporary.",
                "Okay, the numbers are bad. Let's change which numbers we look at.",
